# Build context exclusions.
#
# node_modules dominates the context at ~83MB and is reinstalled in the image
# from the lockfile, so sending it only slows every build.
#
# state/ holds the OAuth private key, client store, refresh tokens and the
# approval secret. Nothing should copy it into an image, and keeping it out of
# the context means nothing can.

.git
.github
node_modules
dist
state
work
outputs
.envrc
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store
